# Note: the bfly_delta percentages stay above the 3% threshold for several
# closed cells (e.g. 1420710 e6 d=5 +16.812%), but the LEDGER's status
# computation is bytes>3 AND (bfly>3 OR ssim2<-1.0). When bytes drops
# below 3%, the cell flips to FIXED regardless of bfly/ssim2. These cells
# are now bytes-FIXED but the bfly gap is the remaining F-D structural
# residual (per `f_d_residual_exhausted_2026-05-18.md`).
